"text": "You're wearing a soft pink mohair long sleeve that drapes gently over your frame, paired with classic cream bermuda shorts and a fitted waist vest for structure. On your feet are cozy beige suede loafers with a tassel detail, and you carry a small burgundy chain bag that adds a rich pop of color. Over the top, there is a light pink open cardigan with a delicate geometric pattern to keep things airy.",
"how_to_wear": [
"The mohair knit feels so soft against your skin on a crisp autumn day in the park.",
"You can take the cardigan off when you get warm from walking around the park or sitting by the coffee shop later."
