{
"n": "#47·20",
"text": "This long sleeve top is crafted from a soft mohair fabric in a warm powder pink shade. It has a relaxed silhouette with a crew neckline and long sleeves that provide comfort without restriction."
},
{
"n": "#163·12",
"text": "The classic cream bermuda shorts feature a tailored fit with structured sides and a high waistline. They include a matching vest layer that creates a polished, put-together look perfect for an evening outing."
},
{
"n": "#266·05",
"text": "These beige suede loafers are slip-on style with a classic tassel strap across the top and a comfortable flat sole. The smooth leather finish adds a touch of sophistication to any outfit."
},
{
"n": "#129·35",
"text": "A compact burgundy chain bag with a distinctive 'B' logo closure offers both style and functionality. Its rich deep red tone contrasts beautifully against your lighter colored clothes for visual interest."
},
{
"n": "#209·20",
"text": "This powder pink cardigan features an intricate open-knit diamond pattern across the front with wide balloon sleeves. It includes a matching white belt that cinches at your waist to create definition."
}
